 minutes","rest minutes"],["note summary","note summary"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A recipe","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"A Recipe for Study Success","paras":["**Ingredients:** a quiet place, a clear goal, a timer, and a notebook. **Step 1:** **consider** your goal and write it down. **Step 2:** study for 25 minutes, then rest for 5. **Step 3:** review notes before bed.","**Tip:** **consider** teaching a friend what you learned. If you can explain it, you know it."],"kicker":"STUDY RECIPE","by":"Learning Kitchen","gloss":[["ingredient","ingrediente"],["step","etapa"],["review","revisar"],["goal","meta"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"You need a quiet place.","ans":"T","why":"a quiet place."},{"q":"You study for 25 minutes and rest 50.","ans":"F","why":"rest for 5."},{"q":"Teaching a friend helps.","ans":"T","why":"teaching a friend."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“ingredient” = ?","opts":["ingrediente","instrução","interesse"],"ans":0,"why":"ingredient."},{"q":"“review” = ?","opts":["revisar","rever só","rever"],"ans":0,"why":"review."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Instructions and consider","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Função","Frases"],"rows":[["listar itens","**Ingredients: … / You need…**"],["ordenar passos","**Step 1… Then… Finally…**"],["sugerir","**Consider + -ing: Consider teaching a friend.**"],["condição","**If you can explain it, you know it.**"]],"cap":"Instructions and consider"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**consider + -ing** (ou substantivo) = pensar em/levar em conta: *Consider studying earlier.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ your goal and write it down. (Consider)","a":"Consider","why":"imperativo."},{"s":"Consider ___ a friend. (teach)","a":"teaching","why":"consider + -ing."},{"s":"Review notes _